law.text:
		Every registrant shall record, maintain for two years, and make available for inspection by the Department the following information:

The name and address of each location or person from which the registrant obtained the waste kitchen grease for transportation;


The quantity of material received from each location or person;


The date on which the waste kitchen grease was obtained from each location or person; and


The renderer or other processor to which the waste kitchen grease was delivered.
